Package: setup-device
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CI-OS Team
Description: Headless device first-time WiFi setup system (Mint backend)
 Headless device setup system providing captive portal for WiFi configuration.
 Includes hostapd hotspot, dnsmasq DHCP/DNS, nginx web server, and Flask backend.
Depends: hostapd, dnsmasq, nginx-light, python3, python3-flask, python3-gunicorn, network-manager
